// reports ONLY SEMANTIC errors (complexity, no-unused-vars, max-lines-per-function,
// max-params). The cosmetic `--fix` runs exactly ONCE as the terminal pipeline
// formatStage; running it mid-run reformats the model's file between attempts, so
// the model iterates on a state it did not write and drives an unfixable
// lint("unused import") <-> tsc("cannot find name") oscillation.
